  "purpose": "The Argorix checker and linker in compiler/ over real files, through the compiler-host boundary, under gcc, clang and the sanitizers. The differentials against stage0 over the whole corpus are crates/argorixc/tests/check_differential.rs and link_differential.rs.",
  "cases": [
